WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:06.562
A wrinkled transferee!

00:00:09.053 --> 00:00:14.353
A small hill which Kurin found
looked exactly like Pony's hill.

00:00:15.113 --> 00:00:22.146
Candy's heart found a new hope after
being overwhelmed by circumstances.

00:00:27.277 --> 00:00:28.638
I won't give up.

00:00:29.136 --> 00:00:31.993
I'm going to get back to Eliza
for her pranks.

00:00:41.337 --> 00:00:46.141
So I named that hill "The other Pony's hill".

00:00:46.338 --> 00:00:51.308
I could clearly see sister Lane and you
while I was up there.

00:00:52.981 --> 00:00:54.214
What was that?

00:00:56.992 --> 00:00:58.669
Say, what's the matter?

00:01:04.816 --> 00:01:06.007
Terry!

00:01:06.867 --> 00:01:09.139
Terrius, this is girls' ward.

00:01:10.331 --> 00:01:13.537
-I know.
-Why did you sneak in here then?

00:01:14.130 --> 00:01:18.312
-How did that punk get inside?
-He's got some guts...

00:01:19.642 --> 00:01:21.859
Terrius, were you drinking?

00:01:21.911 --> 00:01:24.199
If you'd like, you can join me.

00:01:25.144 --> 00:01:27.315
What are you saying?

00:01:27.905 --> 00:01:30.355
Good evening, my ladies!

00:01:30.390 --> 00:01:33.242
Your staring expressions
are pretty amusing.

00:01:33.992 --> 00:01:37.382
Maybe I snuck into a zoo by mistake.

00:01:39.675 --> 00:01:42.142
Terrius!
Return to boys' ward immediately!

00:01:42.143 --> 00:01:45.992
-Tommorrow...
-...I'm to report to director's office, right?

00:01:46.113 --> 00:01:48.882
-Terrius!
-Well then, I bid you farewell.

00:01:53.155 --> 00:01:58.951
Oh, and put the broken glass on
my dad's account, sister Margaret.

00:02:04.701 --> 00:02:09.408
-How can he be so cool?
-He likes upsetting other people!

00:02:09.443 --> 00:02:13.003
Be quiet!
Everybody, return to your rooms!

00:02:14.700 --> 00:02:18.677
-Patty, I haven't seen you in a while.
-Yes...

00:02:20.142 --> 00:02:23.773
-Patty!
-Candy, I'm sorry. I have to go.

00:02:31.462 --> 00:02:35.155
Of course. Eliza and others
told her not to speak to me.

00:02:35.190 --> 00:02:37.306
-Never mind then!
-Candice!

00:02:37.400 --> 00:02:38.132
Yes?

00:02:38.167 --> 00:02:40.809
-Hurry back to your room.
-I will!

00:02:43.209 --> 00:02:44.633
Patty?

00:02:45.814 --> 00:02:47.097
Patty!

00:02:48.813 --> 00:02:53.963
Uh, you... I'm sorry!
It seems though I missed the room!

00:02:53.998 --> 00:02:56.492
Missed...? Uh...

00:02:58.736 --> 00:03:03.580
-I'm looking for my granddaughter Patty!
-Oh, Patty is right next door!

00:03:03.615 --> 00:03:06.685
-Here you go.
-Thank you!

00:03:18.670 --> 00:03:22.274
-Grandma!
-You look great, Patty!

00:03:22.310 --> 00:03:24.371
How come you got in here?

00:03:25.841 --> 00:03:27.669
I used a little magic!

00:03:27.971 --> 00:03:30.166
There'll be trouble if
they find you here!

00:03:30.633 --> 00:03:32.873
This is a nice room...

00:03:32.908 --> 00:03:34.679
Your wardrobe is here, right?

00:03:38.212 --> 00:03:39.608
Grandma...

00:03:39.652 --> 00:03:42.952
I'll put my clothes on the hangers
so that they don't get all wrinkled.

00:03:42.987 --> 00:03:44.168
Wrinkled...?

00:03:45.614 --> 00:03:50.424
I came in order to enjoy a student's
life together with you, Patty!

00:03:50.811 --> 00:03:52.892
Grandma... but...!

00:03:52.927 --> 00:03:55.325
Aren't you glad that you won't
be alone, Patty?

00:03:55.587 --> 00:04:01.234
You're kidding me! Family members
aren't supposed to enter these buildings!

00:04:01.438 --> 00:04:02.373
Moreover...

00:04:02.408 --> 00:04:05.162
Don't worry. I'll take care
that nobody discovers me.

00:04:05.368 --> 00:04:09.277
It's impossible! Whenever some of my
friends stopped by, they knew straightaway!

00:04:10.238 --> 00:04:14.162
Patty, you're a fraidycat,
just like your grandpa!

00:04:14.390 --> 00:04:16.529
-But...
-Say, Patty...

00:04:16.935 --> 00:04:20.255
If it's okay with you,
she could stay in my room.

00:04:20.655 --> 00:04:22.363
Your room?

00:04:22.364 --> 00:04:28.369
Yes. Since noone comes to my room,
nobody will be able to discover her!

00:04:28.754 --> 00:04:29.920
But...

00:04:29.955 --> 00:04:32.156
I'd be grateful if you did that for me!

00:04:33.330 --> 00:04:34.821
Grandma...!

00:04:36.379 --> 00:04:38.450
Your heart is pounding so much!

00:04:38.486 --> 00:04:42.579
You'll have a coronary if I stay here!

00:04:45.356 --> 00:04:47.784
And you are...?

00:04:47.819 --> 00:04:50.031
Call me Candy!

00:04:50.066 --> 00:04:53.028
That's a nice name!
I am Marsha.

00:04:54.882 --> 00:04:56.689
I'll help you with your luggage!

00:04:56.893 --> 00:04:58.065
Thank you.

00:04:58.747 --> 00:05:01.555
-I can carry this.
-Okay.

00:05:03.622 --> 00:05:04.491
Candy!

00:05:05.829 --> 00:05:09.420
-Make sure that nobody sees her.
-That's right!

00:05:14.479 --> 00:05:18.569
That was close!
Granny, now's the time!

00:05:18.709 --> 00:05:23.283
Okay! I somehow feel like
a young girl again!

00:05:32.005 --> 00:05:34.538
Welcome! It's a little cramped but...

00:05:36.429 --> 00:05:40.342
-Candy, I'm a little worried about one thing.
-What is it?

00:05:40.985 --> 00:05:43.799
Why don't you have friends
over at your room?

00:05:44.032 --> 00:05:47.698
They've turned their backs on me.

00:05:47.733 --> 00:05:49.790
They did that?

00:05:50.444 --> 00:05:53.667
Yes. But I don't worry about that.

00:05:54.858 --> 00:05:58.655
That's right... the worst thing one could
do is to worry over such things.

00:05:59.882 --> 00:06:03.528
That's right... here, I made the bed for you.

00:06:03.563 --> 00:06:07.913
But how come you didn't want
to sleep in Patty's room?

00:06:08.278 --> 00:06:13.221
I didn't come here
to see my granddaughter.

00:06:13.624 --> 00:06:15.416
In that case... why?

00:06:15.794 --> 00:06:21.470
I finally wanted to experience
the students' way of life.

00:06:21.604 --> 00:06:24.904
Granny, so you never went to school?

00:06:25.597 --> 00:06:27.708
No, never.

00:06:27.743 --> 00:06:30.090
Your family didn't treat you right...

00:06:32.113 --> 00:06:33.546
It was exactly the opposite.

00:06:34.467 --> 00:06:37.132
I was a daughter of a rich family.

00:06:38.634 --> 00:06:43.668
My parents didn't want me to get
bullied in the school for that,

00:06:46.488 --> 00:06:49.723
...so they brought seven teachers
who educated me at home.

00:06:50.848 --> 00:06:52.168
Seven teachers?

00:06:56.712 --> 00:06:59.742
But I wanted to attend an ordinary
school so much!

00:07:01.230 --> 00:07:02.954
That's why you came to this dorm...

00:07:03.921 --> 00:07:06.731
I wanted to make my dream come true!

00:07:07.495 --> 00:07:10.039
That's right!
I'll let you hear something nice!

00:07:10.074 --> 00:07:12.228
That's a violin, right?

00:07:13.142 --> 00:07:15.298
It's a memento of a late grandfather.

00:07:27.447 --> 00:07:28.874
Grandma!

00:07:29.056 --> 00:07:31.080
They'll find her if somebody hears this!

00:07:39.097 --> 00:07:40.175
God...

00:08:04.498 --> 00:08:06.915
It's like I'm being beckoned into a dream.

00:08:10.633 --> 00:08:11.826
Somebody is here!

00:08:12.472 --> 00:08:13.720
I'd better hurry...!

00:08:16.637 --> 00:08:17.983
I'm right there!

00:08:18.572 --> 00:08:22.865
Candice, if you play your violin this late
at night, it could bother other people.

00:08:22.900 --> 00:08:23.916
I'm sorry.

00:08:26.633 --> 00:08:30.235
That's strange... Candy playing a violin...

00:08:31.658 --> 00:08:33.060
The coast is clear!

00:08:34.450 --> 00:08:37.190
The student's life is so much fun!

00:08:38.728 --> 00:08:40.628
I don't think anybody will come
after this.

00:08:40.803 --> 00:08:43.905
I wanted to play a little more...

00:08:44.759 --> 00:08:48.007
That's right! I'd better study
maths for tomorrow!

00:08:48.209 --> 00:08:50.236
Lemme see.

00:08:50.693 --> 00:08:53.407
I'm not good in maths.

00:08:55.331 --> 00:08:58.874
Why, this is easy! I can show you.

00:08:58.909 --> 00:09:00.582
Granny, you?

00:09:00.617 --> 00:09:03.747
I told you that I had seven teachers!

00:09:09.361 --> 00:09:13.365
You did well.
You must be working hard, Candice.

00:09:13.400 --> 00:09:14.911
Yes... a little.

00:09:15.567 --> 00:09:17.399
Everyone, do your best.

00:09:18.053 --> 00:09:24.107
Candice just transferred to our school,
but she's already ahead of everybody.

00:09:25.118 --> 00:09:30.069
That's strange... last night she did great
on violin, today she's good at maths...

00:09:37.264 --> 00:09:38.362
Candy!

00:09:39.985 --> 00:09:41.970
I have a favor to ask.

00:09:42.470 --> 00:09:45.370
You want ideas for new pranks?

00:09:45.405 --> 00:09:49.152
I'd like you to play your violin for us.
Does that sound like a prank?

00:09:49.350 --> 00:09:50.883
Eliza...

00:09:51.214 --> 00:09:56.081
-This evening, at the dance salon.
-You have let us hear your playing again!

00:09:56.116 --> 00:09:59.466
I'm still not comfortable with
playing in front of the audience...

00:09:59.568 --> 00:10:03.034
It doesn't matter. If you can play like
you did last night, it'll be great!

00:10:03.069 --> 00:10:04.081
We have to hear it!

00:10:04.116 --> 00:10:06.389
But... if you let me practice a little more...

00:10:07.652 --> 00:10:10.722
Or maybe you're hiding something
in your room?

00:10:10.979 --> 00:10:13.359
You wouldn't mind us taking a look then?

00:10:16.420 --> 00:10:17.388
I understand.

00:10:17.389 --> 00:10:19.798
If you want to hear it that much,
I'll play for you.

00:10:23.819 --> 00:10:26.516
*Denjin Anime Fansub*

00:10:30.657 --> 00:10:36.618
So, unless you do great playing a violin,
they'll discover that you're hiding the old lady?

00:10:36.653 --> 00:10:39.527
That's right. Don't you have any
good ideas?

00:10:39.684 --> 00:10:44.778
We'd help you... but there's no way
you'd learn how to play by tonight...

00:10:44.981 --> 00:10:50.129
My best inventions always come
in the time of dire need... that's it!

00:10:50.785 --> 00:10:54.433
Hey, it's not one of your shoddy
inventions again, isn't it?

00:10:54.468 --> 00:10:58.152
Actually, there is a very simple
solution to Candy's problem!

00:10:58.582 --> 00:11:00.526
Tell me, Stear!

00:11:00.561 --> 00:11:03.369
You see, I'll build another violin.

00:11:03.404 --> 00:11:05.969
Can you build a violin so easily?

00:11:06.004 --> 00:11:08.864
What, I only need to know the
shape of a violin.

00:11:08.899 --> 00:11:11.020
And you, Candy, will take that violin!

00:11:12.131 --> 00:11:14.289
But the trick will be in this!

00:11:14.324 --> 00:11:16.478
Almost like a childish prank!

00:11:16.513 --> 00:11:21.866
What, with a little help from us,
you'll be playing well in no time.

00:11:24.021 --> 00:11:26.842
Now it's up to me to make a violin.

00:11:27.276 --> 00:11:30.012
I'm suspicious... will it be alright?

00:11:30.567 --> 00:11:31.902
I'm on it!

00:11:34.124 --> 00:11:36.627
So this is the fake violin?

00:11:39.008 --> 00:11:43.700
I'm sorry... but could you practice
a bit while hiding behind the curtain?

00:11:43.911 --> 00:11:48.848
Can do! My student's life
is suddenly becoming even more fun!

00:11:49.209 --> 00:11:49.971
Uh-oh.

00:11:56.075 --> 00:11:58.115
What, it's you, Patty!

00:11:58.448 --> 00:11:59.645
Granny!

00:12:01.978 --> 00:12:05.641
Scaring your grandma like that,
you bad, bad granddaughter!

00:12:05.738 --> 00:12:09.038
Say, Candy, is it true that
you're going to play violin?

00:12:09.073 --> 00:12:11.050
Yes, I'll play for them.

00:12:11.085 --> 00:12:12.239
But Candy...

00:12:12.438 --> 00:12:14.703
I'll just move my arms like I'm
playing the instrument.

00:12:15.627 --> 00:12:17.260
Then the grandma will...

00:12:18.864 --> 00:12:23.189
A student's life is supposed
to have some suspense and excitement!

00:12:23.230 --> 00:12:25.659
If you do that... and if
they discover you...

00:12:26.580 --> 00:12:30.054
Patty, your heart is pounding again...

00:12:30.089 --> 00:12:33.103
Patty, maybe we'll really pull it off.

00:12:33.392 --> 00:12:37.540
Yeah, a student's life can be
incredibly fun indeed!

00:12:43.556 --> 00:12:48.633
I, Candice White Adley
will now play the violin for you.

00:12:49.443 --> 00:12:52.539
But before that, could you turn
the lights down a bit?

00:12:52.692 --> 00:12:54.203
I won't be in the mood otherwise.

00:12:55.937 --> 00:12:57.719
I'm not very good yet.

00:13:02.443 --> 00:13:04.759
Where did you learn this, Candy?

00:13:10.341 --> 00:13:11.814
She's good.

00:13:13.040 --> 00:13:14.767
...but it's nothing special!

00:13:35.308 --> 00:13:37.939
Candy, you're not playing right!

00:13:38.586 --> 00:13:40.115
Stop!

00:13:40.619 --> 00:13:43.763
What, can't your comments
wait till the end?

00:13:44.095 --> 00:13:46.749
I want you to show me that violin.

00:13:47.104 --> 00:13:49.487
It's a very important violin to me...

00:13:49.488 --> 00:13:50.869
Let me see.

00:13:57.114 --> 00:14:00.610
It's a fake!
It could never make that melody.

00:14:01.212 --> 00:14:02.780
What's the meaning of this, Candy?

00:14:03.742 --> 00:14:06.054
There is somebody behind the curtain!

00:14:06.251 --> 00:14:08.739
That's the wind... it's nothing!

00:14:11.682 --> 00:14:12.838
Patty!

00:14:13.288 --> 00:14:15.587
Of course. Just what I thought.

00:14:15.933 --> 00:14:18.794
You were playing violin
in Candy's room.

00:14:18.829 --> 00:14:22.485
You showed her how to do the maths, too.
It was you, right?

00:14:23.593 --> 00:14:27.617
That means that you're Candy's friend.
I'll remember this!

00:14:29.361 --> 00:14:32.709
-Everyone, let's return to our rooms!
-They made fools of us!

00:14:33.667 --> 00:14:36.429
Exactly what I thought!
Candy could never play the violin!

00:14:36.720 --> 00:14:40.364
That's right, she was a dogsbody
up until now!

00:14:43.692 --> 00:14:46.623
-What happened?
-Terrius was here again?

00:14:46.658 --> 00:14:48.066
A ghost...

00:14:48.349 --> 00:14:50.031
A ghost you say?

00:14:50.857 --> 00:14:54.094
It wore a school's uniform...
but its face was all rattled!

00:14:54.395 --> 00:14:55.893
Which way did it go?

00:14:56.299 --> 00:14:58.438
It disappeared around here...

00:15:00.626 --> 00:15:04.866
Now I even became a ghost!
A student's life is great!

00:15:05.098 --> 00:15:08.830
But when did you and Patty
switch places?

00:15:09.158 --> 00:15:12.703
When I realized that she might get
discovered, I hid behind the curtains.

00:15:12.738 --> 00:15:16.025
This is the most exciting thing
I've ever done in my life!

00:15:17.013 --> 00:15:21.165
Those seven teachers couldn't have
taught me things this fun!

00:15:23.484 --> 00:15:24.707
Patty!

00:15:25.026 --> 00:15:27.806
Oh! Is something in your eye?

00:15:28.027 --> 00:15:31.681
Grandma... I'm begging you,
please go home...

00:15:31.895 --> 00:15:35.005
Come on, don't cry... okay?

00:15:35.040 --> 00:15:40.316
Ever since you came here, I keep thinking
that my heart is going to explode...

00:15:40.351 --> 00:15:41.951
I see.

00:15:41.986 --> 00:15:45.269
Before leaving, I still have
one favor to ask of you!

00:15:45.304 --> 00:15:46.643
What is it?

00:15:46.678 --> 00:15:52.027
I've never been in a classroom before.
I want to go there and attend class!

00:15:52.062 --> 00:15:56.511
-Grandma!
-Patty, hang in there!

00:15:56.546 --> 00:15:59.429
She's a bit faint-hearted, isn't she?

00:16:03.357 --> 00:16:04.659
Hurry!

00:16:09.269 --> 00:16:11.159
The classrooms are that way.

00:16:20.184 --> 00:16:21.582
Granny!

00:16:22.964 --> 00:16:24.348
Hide your face!

00:16:26.348 --> 00:16:27.619
Uh...

00:16:28.808 --> 00:16:33.497
She isn't feeling too well,
so I'm taking her to the nurse's room...

00:16:39.135 --> 00:16:44.558
-So exciting!
...life in school...

00:16:46.492 --> 00:16:49.382
So this is the classroom?

00:16:50.043 --> 00:16:55.693
Who'd think that I would get to use this
book in school... it's a dream come true!

00:16:55.728 --> 00:16:59.447
Today's class is beginning.

00:16:59.482 --> 00:17:02.642
I wish I could take you to our classroom but...

00:17:02.677 --> 00:17:06.370
This one is fine! If I listen carefully,
I can hear everything!

00:17:07.216 --> 00:17:10.100
Anyway, I'm off to class!

00:17:10.324 --> 00:17:13.323
-I'll sit right here.
-Okay!

00:17:16.797 --> 00:17:20.230
-Where were you, Candice?
-Sorry!

00:17:20.650 --> 00:17:24.849
You can't become a prominent
lady if you aren't puncutal.

00:17:25.216 --> 00:17:26.477
I'll be more careful!

00:17:27.066 --> 00:17:30.856
We will be grading today.
Hand over your exam prints.

00:17:31.095 --> 00:17:32.325
Grading?

00:17:33.066 --> 00:17:37.856
Are you saying that you didn't
receive a print, just like Patricia?

00:17:38.524 --> 00:17:39.790
Patty...

00:17:42.532 --> 00:17:44.127
-Louise!
-Yes!

00:17:44.162 --> 00:17:48.696
-You gave a print to Candice, haven't you?
-Of course!

00:17:48.731 --> 00:17:52.712
-I went to her room and delivered it.
-That's a lie!

00:17:53.546 --> 00:17:57.061
-I haven't received anything!
-Be quiet!

00:17:57.849 --> 00:18:03.102
Since you forgot about the print, why are you
saying that you didn't even receive one?

00:18:05.811 --> 00:18:08.616
Patricia and Candice, stand out
in front of the class!

00:18:09.146 --> 00:18:15.388
What are they saying, that they delivered
the prints to her! I was there all the time!

00:18:17.226 --> 00:18:21.068
What is that?
The neighboring classroom should have been vacant.

00:18:21.645 --> 00:18:24.387
-I'll take a look!
-Candice!

00:18:25.717 --> 00:18:31.979
-There is nobody over there.
-Candice, I want you to stand still.

00:18:33.196 --> 00:18:38.501
So this is the best school in England?
With everybody being so mean to Candy...

00:18:38.536 --> 00:18:41.444
I don't want to live as a student anymore.

00:18:41.479 --> 00:18:44.037
But not all people are bad as them!

00:18:44.656 --> 00:18:49.745
No, that goes for the students. As for the
teachers, I don't agree with their teaching methods!

00:18:50.153 --> 00:18:52.890
Grandma, your voice is too loud!

00:18:53.364 --> 00:18:56.669
You see, I was grateful to my parents for
not sending me into a regular school.

00:18:56.845 --> 00:19:00.420
But I still wasn't sure whether having seven
private teachers was better than attending regular school.

00:19:00.824 --> 00:19:03.313
If that were true, I would've taken Patty
back with myself.

00:19:03.474 --> 00:19:04.835
Grandma...

00:19:05.005 --> 00:19:09.143
However, there is one thing which you
can't possibly get with home schooling.

00:19:10.153 --> 00:19:11.552
One thing?

00:19:12.382 --> 00:19:18.843
Yes. When you're locked up in the house, you can't
make friends with wonderful people like Candy.

00:19:19.028 --> 00:19:23.831
-Candy, take care after Patty.
-Yeah...

00:19:24.998 --> 00:19:30.602
Also, send my regards to the young man who came
to the dormitory on purpose just to make a mess!

00:19:33.212 --> 00:19:35.080
To Terrius?

00:19:35.268 --> 00:19:40.268
Yeah. I managed to sneak in because
he was drawing away all the attention!

00:19:41.100 --> 00:19:45.170
-Well then, goodbye.
-Grandma, if someone sees you...

00:19:45.329 --> 00:19:49.252
It's okay.
Getting out of here will be much easier!

00:19:49.379 --> 00:19:52.303
I snuck like a thief on my way in!

00:19:53.720 --> 00:19:59.123
-Grandma!
-Patty, I'm sure your grandma has a good idea.

00:20:01.523 --> 00:20:09.530
Uh... my granddaughter, Patricia,
lives in this dormitory.

00:20:09.847 --> 00:20:11.358
Patricia?

00:20:11.550 --> 00:20:15.217
Yes! I'd like to see her,
even if for just a moment.

00:20:15.410 --> 00:20:22.100
Unfortunately, it's against regulations for
family members to meet students within the dormitory.

00:20:22.310 --> 00:20:28.155
Oh, I see... well if that's the case,
I'll be on my way...

00:20:28.190 --> 00:20:32.554
-Where is the exit then?
-I'll show you.

00:20:32.776 --> 00:20:36.462
-Let me help with your luggagge.
-Oh, thank you...

00:20:36.463 --> 00:20:40.133
-Of course, that's what she had in mind...
-She's so much trouble.

00:20:44.228 --> 00:20:49.959
She's so nice! Someday, I want
to be a nice granny, just like her!

00:20:50.650 --> 00:20:54.927
-Candy, would you be my friend?
-Of course!

00:20:55.358 --> 00:21:01.688
She said that the best thing about school
is making friends, right?

00:21:01.723 --> 00:21:02.595
Yeah!

00:21:05.220 --> 00:21:07.281
Coming and going like the wind,

00:21:07.316 --> 00:21:17.704
...it was Patricia's grandmother who built
a firm bond between Candy's and Patricia's hearts.

00:21:17.739 --> 00:21:19.472
To be continued.
